    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XX} Gif mon on folces gemote cyninges gerefan geyppe eofot, ⁊ his eft geswican wille, gestæle on ryhtran hand, gif he mæge; gif he ne mæge, ðolie his angyldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person should reveal an offense to the king’s reeve in the folk assembly, and he afterwards wishes to withdraw [the accusation], let him accuse the correct party if he can; if he cannot, let him forfeit the single-payment [due him for the offense].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone makes an accusation [against another] at a public meeting, in the presence of the king's reeve, and afterwards wishes to withdraw it, he shall prefer the charge, if he can, against a more likely person. If he cannot, he shall lose the value due to him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XX. Gif mon on folces gemote cyninges gerefan geeofot yppe , ⁊ his eft geswican wille, gestæle on ryhtran hond, gif he mage; gif he ne mæge, ðolige his angildes, ond fó to ðam wite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
